# Build context for the frontend image.
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` sends 314MB of node_modules built on the host and
# copies them OVER the ones `npm ci` just installed in the Alpine builder.
# Native modules compiled for Windows do not run on Alpine, so the build
# either fails or produces an image that breaks at runtime — the worst kind,
# because it builds clean.
node_modules
.output
.vinxi
dist

# Never bake VCS history or secrets into an image.
.git
.gitignore
*.env
.env*

# Engine data: the audit database, fetched sanctions lists and stress
# fixtures. Hundreds of megabytes the frontend image has no use for, and the
# engine gets them through a volume rather than a copy.
engine/data

# Test and tooling output nothing in the image needs.
coverage
.tmp-*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
